Here's one I haven't seen in here before (granted, Ive only been reading 
this Newsgroup for a coupla months).  I was on Dlvl. 8 in a throne room.  
When I kicked the chest (which always seems to be in a throne room), I
got the following, "A tower or flame erupts from the chest.  Your scroll 
of blank paper burns.  Your 2 clear potions boil and explode.  For an 
instant you could see right through yourself".  What the heck is THAT?  
I've torched scrolls and boiled potions before, but never saw through 
myself...  As usual, this game is full of surprises!!

